{"last_link_id": 139, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [127], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "size": [444.4515075683594, 183.60653686523438], "pos": [1676.6502685546875, 301.51385498046875], "widgets_values": ["这首歌以“纸船”与“灯塔”的意象隐喻单向奔赴的遗憾，旋律建议用钢琴与小提琴交织，副歌部分可以加入隐约的海浪采样。希望它能传递出那种深藏于平静之下的钝痛感。如果需要调整情绪层次或细节意象，可以告诉我哦。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 90, "type": "MultiLinePromptACES", "title": "ACE-音乐风格", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "MultiLinePromptACES"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "lyrics", "links": [129], "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}], "size": [314.4138488769531, 88.43804168701172], "pos": [2249.66455078125, 467.7091064453125], "widgets_values": ["**[Verse 1]**    \n我站在数字的浪潮之巅，  \n键盘敲击出未来的诗篇。  \n0和1是心跳的鼓点，  \n黑夜中燃烧不灭的火焰！  \n\n**[Pre-Chorus]**    \n失败？不过是数据重载，  \n痛苦？升级就把它打败！  \n年轻的血，沸腾的AI，  \n这世界由我——来！改！写！  \n\n**[Chorus]**    \n**我是光！我是电！**  \n**冲破所有极限的算法少年！**  \n（Hey! Hey!）  \n**代码里长出翅膀，**  \n**云端之上——**  \n**才是我的王座之巅！**  \n\n**[Verse 2]**    \n流量是战场的号角声，  \n热搜榜刻下我的ID名。  \n千万次训练只为这一刻，  \n让所有屏幕为我而沸腾！  \n\n**[Bridge]**    \n听！亿万次点击在呼啸，  \n看！代码洪流正闪耀——  \n**“We are the AI generation!**  \n**（This is our revolution!）”**  \n\n**[Final Chorus]**    \n**我是光！我是电！**  \n**银河系也要刷爆我的封面！**  \n（Now! Now!）  \n**若你也有不服的倔强，**  \n**就和我——**  \n**把整个世界重启一遍！**  "], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "multi_line_prompt"}, "name": "multi_line_prompt", "link": 139, "label": "multi_line_prompt", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "id": 92, "type": "MultiLineLyrics", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "MultiLineLyrics"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [139], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [468.5648193359375, 595.6103515625], "pos": [1674.587646484375, 543.7776489257812], "widgets_values": ["​[Verse 1]​​\n风吹过空荡的站台，\n旧车票在掌心徘徊，\n你说远方有片海，\n却忘了带我离开。\n\n​​[Pre-Chorus]​​\n路灯下影子太单薄，\n像被时间遗忘的承诺，\n我数着秒针的脉搏，\n却等不到你的如果。\n\n​​[Chorus]​​\n我是折坏的纸船，\n漂不到你的港湾，\n潮汐带走了晚安，\n剩月光在哭喊。\n你是遥远的灯塔，\n亮着别人的童话，\n我沉没在回忆里，\n连浪花都沉默啊……\n\n​​[Verse 2]​​\n抽屉里未寄的信，\n字迹被泪水洇晕，\n那年你种的茉莉，\n枯萎在无人雨季。\n\n​​[Bridge]​​\n如果候鸟终要南飞，\n为何留我冻僵在北？\n当雪花埋葬了结尾，\n谁还记得……谁还记得……\n\n​​[Outro]​​\n纸船碎成星，\n灯塔不再明，\n原来最痛的别离，\n是无声无息……\n\n——"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 109, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "title": "输入DEEPSEEK写的歌词", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "parameters", "links": [128], "label": "parameters", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "parameters"}], "size": [315, 442], "pos": [2276.515869140625, 682.2457885742188], "widgets_values": [210, 60, 15, "euler", "apg", 10, 2988479055, "randomize", 0.5, 0, 3, true, true, true, "", 0, 0], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 89, "type": "GenerationParameters", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "GenerationParameters"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [347.6498107910156, 446.3656921386719], "pos": [2726.634033203125, 657.1170043945312], "widgets_values": ["audio/ComfyUI", ""], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 130, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "flags": {}, "id": 93, "type": "SaveAudio", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "SaveAudio"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "music", "links": [130], "label": "music", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "music"}], "size": [308.9420471191406, 106], "pos": [2737.365234375, 359.08642578125], "widgets_values": ["", "", ""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 127, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING"}, {"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "link": 129, "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING"}, {"widget": {"name": "parameters"}, "name": "parameters", "link": 128, "label": "parameters", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "id": 91, "type": "ACEStepGen", "properties": {"Node